    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-01-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-01",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：A"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先由图得到大圆弦AB对应的圆心角：OO′=20、O′A=20，直角△OO′A为等腰直角三角形，所以∠AOB=90°。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "弯月面积等于半径20的小半圆面积，减去大圆弦AB上方的圆弓形。小半圆为200π；大圆弓形为90°扇形200π减△AOB面积400。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "S=\\frac12\\pi20^2-\\left[\\frac14\\pi(20\\sqrt2)^2-\\frac12\\times40\\times20\\right]=400"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "两块相减只剩400平方米，我们选A。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
