    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-02-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第2题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-02",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（25联考）底面半径为6cm，高为20cm的圆柱体容器，现放入一个半径为3cm 的铁球，水面恰好和铁球高度相平，问原有水面高度（）。",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "2cm"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "3cm"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "4cm"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "5cm"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "D",
        "sourceAnswer": "D"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          149
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          143
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-02-p149.webp",
            "alt": "几何问题（一） · 实战精刷2 · 讲义第143页",
            "pdfPage": 149
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-02-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-02",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：D"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先看放入铁球后的液面：恰好到球顶，深度是球直径6厘米。此时容器中6厘米高度的体积，由原来的水与铁球共同占据。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "球体积4/3×π×3³=36π，相当于在半径6的圆柱中占1厘米的水高。因此原水深为6−1=5厘米。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "\\pi6^2h+\\frac43\\pi3^3=\\pi6^2\\times6\\Rightarrow h=5"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "所以我们选D。容器总高20厘米不影响这次体积守恒。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
