    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-04-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第4题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-04",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26江苏）一种实心圆柱形配件由内芯和外壳组成，内芯也是圆柱形，和外壳高度相同且与外壳之间无间隙。该配件的底面直径为8cm；内芯的密度为3g/cm³，底面直径为4cm；外壳的密度为8g/cm³，质量为16kg，则内芯的质量为：",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "2kg"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "3kg"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "4kg"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "6kg"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "A",
        "sourceAnswer": "A"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          150
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          144
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-04-p150.webp",
            "alt": "几何问题（一） · 实战精刷4 · 讲义第144页",
            "pdfPage": 150
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-04-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-04",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：A"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先比较体积，内外同高。内芯半径2、整个配件半径4，内芯底面积4π，外壳底面积16π−4π=12π，所以体积比1：3。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "质量还要乘密度，内芯与外壳质量比为（1×3）：（3×8）=1：8。外壳16千克，内芯2千克。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "\\frac{m_{\\text{内}}}{m_{\\text{壳}}}=\\frac{2^2}{4^2-2^2}\\times\\frac38=\\frac18"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "所以我们选A。外壳不是半径4的实心整圆柱，必须先减去内芯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
